Value [drop-down list] - Checkbox
Select if the Checkbox is active (true) or not (false).
Remarks
The Checkbox looks like this by default:
Plant Simulation automatically switches between the icons of the check box according to their name/state.
Always create a set of two icons, one for on and one for off, and name them accordingly.
Assign names in pairs to the icons according to their state, for example TrueIcon1 and FalseIcon1.
